{"format_version":"vbulletin-3+-thread","url":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/trinity/174805-from-z-to-quantum-adventure-aberrant-questions","id":174805,"title":"From Z To Quantum, Adventure - Aberrant questions","path":["Home","Onyx Path","Onyx Path Worlds","The Trinity Continuum"],"posts":[{"date":"2014-06-19T18:41:11-07:00","id":174805,"title":"From Z To Quantum, Adventure - Aberrant questions","content":"im running this sort of maybe crossover between aberrant and adventure. i recently got aberrant (still reading it) and i got a few questions...<br /> Are the events of adventure directly related to the birth of the novas?<br /> Whatever happend to the heroes of yesterday? i mean, what happend to those affected by the Z waves and what happend to this source of energy?","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>Forum's Official's Joker and Trickster. Pardon my bad english, aint my first language (I Speak Spanish).<br /> ST: DtF, HtR, WtO, MtA<br /> Signature Chars: Crowley (hakalu), Joe The Nuwisha (WtA)<br /> Changelings: be afraid of the Technocracian High Five of Doom","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1754-crowley","name":"Crowley","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1754_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Dec 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1639"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-06-19T21:10:52-07:00","id":174931,"title":"","content":"well for what i know they are related. Dr. Primoris from the the Aeon Society recreated the Hammersmith accident and thereby creating the Novas .","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><div align=\"center\"><a href=\"http://www.nodiatis.com/personality.htm\" target=\"_blank\"><img itemprop=\"image\" class=\"bbcode-attachment\" src=\"http://www.nodiatis.com/pub/24.jpg\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" /></a></div>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/619-deadguy","name":"DeadGuy","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar619_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"72"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-06-20T11:56:48-07:00","id":175457,"title":"","content":"They are <i>almost </i>directly related. There was a big gap between the two, but they are intimately connected. The man Michael Daemon Donighal became Dr. Primoris (and later became Divis Mal) after the Hammersmith Incident (which started the Adventure! Age). He grew in power, and eventually either recreated Hammersmith's device or used his own innate Quantum powers to kick-start human evolution into novas. So, the events in Aberrant <i>are</i> related to the events in Adventure! -- in that the events of Aberrant were initiated by a central figure who got the <i>ability</i> to do so from the events in Adventure!.<br /> <br /> Z-Waves faded over time, like a splash in the bathtub or a pond. If there's nothing that keeps making the splash, then eventually the waves get smaller and smaller as they bounce around until eventually you can't tell there were any in the first place.<br /> <br /> As for the heroes of Adventure!... at least one of them died violently (Annabelle Lee Newfield), some of them survived all the way to the Trinity Age (Maxwell Mercer, Whitley Styles), some of them were only known through contemporary events (Jake Stefokowski, one of the best pilots in the Trinity Universe, was known during the Aberrant war as &quot;Jake Danger, Aberrant Hunter&quot;). For the most part, they faded into the background and led lives that were either unimportant enough that no one paid attention, or SO IMPORTANT that their actions had to be hidden from the proles. Regardless, no one hears about them anymore except for Divis Mal -- and only his old, close buddies have the inkling that he was actually Dr. Primoris in the past!","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/2464-lustral_star","name":"lustral_star","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar2464_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Mar 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"302"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-06-22T22:00:32-07:00","id":177675,"title":"","content":"Lustral_star answered most of your questions; I\u2019ll add only that Z-Rays and Telluric Energy are terms coined in the 20s to refer to the poorly understood energies released by Hammersmith\u2019s experiment. By the Nova age, one subset of those energies is much better understood and referred to as Quantum; by the \u00c6on era, the other subset is better understood and called either Noetic energy or Psi.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><div style=\"margin-left:40px\"> <div align=\"center\">My hacks: <a href=\"http://tinyurl.com/dwtrin\" target=\"_blank\"><span style=\"color:#0000FF\">Trinity Continuum</span></a>, <a href=\"http://tinyurl.com/dwscion\" target=\"_blank\"><span style=\"color:#008000\">Scion</span></a>, <a href=\"http://tinyurl.com/dwExalt\" target=\"_blank\"><span style=\"color:#DAA520\">Exalted</span></a>, <a href=\"http://tinyurl.com/dwcwod\" target=\"_blank\"><span style=\"color:#800000\">World of Darkness</span></a>, <a href=\"http://tinyurl.com/dwnwod\" target=\"_blank\"><span style=\"color:#FF0000\">Chronicles of Darkness</span></a></div> </div>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/421-dataweaver","name":"Dataweaver","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar421_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"8420"}]},"thankedby":[]}]}